# Old Bonegrinder's end state (docs/regions/old_bonegrinder.md §6). Conversations that change who is left at the
# mill after Morgantha falls end here, so `bonegrinder_fate` and `pastry_trade` always say what later regions should
# see. (Fights set them just before `combat`, since a lost fight ends the game.) A bargain sets them in morgantha.

~ reckon
if flag.morgantha_slain and flag.offalia_slain and flag.bella_slain
set bonegrinder_fate = "destroyed"
set pastry_trade = "ended"
elif flag.morgantha_slain and flag.bella_pact and not flag.bella_slain and not flag.bella_fled
set bonegrinder_fate = "bella"
set pastry_trade = "dwindling"
elif flag.morgantha_slain
set bonegrinder_fate = "broken"
set pastry_trade = "dwindling"
endif
-> END
